227
00:18:18.969 --> 00:18:19.970
Ah.

228
00:18:22.072 --> 00:18:25.242
What is it?

229
00:18:25.742 --> 00:18:28.579
The Scream. The Scream.

230
00:18:28.579 --> 00:18:34.151
Do you mimic The Scream?

231
00:18:36.453 --> 00:18:37.421
It's not that.

232
00:18:43.227 --> 00:18:44.394
